# Copy to .env. Offline (MockPlanner / MockLLM) needs none of this.
#
# The real-model path is model-agnostic at the protocol boundary: any local
# runtime that serves OpenAI-compatible /v1/chat/completions can be used
# (vLLM, llama.cpp server, Ollama proxy, or a site-specific adapter).
#
# The planning assumption is a capable local model, roughly "good 120B-class".
# The model is still untrusted and only proposes QuerySpec JSON.

# --- Local model — production posture (no data egress) ---
# SAFETRE_LLM=real
# SAFETRE_LLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
# SAFETRE_LLM_API_KEY=local
# SAFETRE_LLM_MODEL=local-120b
# SAFETRE_LLM_TEMPERATURE=0
# SAFETRE_LLM_TIMEOUT=60
# SAFETRE_ALLOWED_LLM_HOSTS=localhost,127.0.0.1,::1

# --- Synthetic-data dev only: remote endpoint opt-in ---
# SAFETRE_LLM=real
# SAFETRE_ALLOW_REMOTE_LLM=1
# SAFETRE_LLM_BASE_URL=https://example-llm-provider.invalid/v1
# SAFETRE_LLM_API_KEY=dev-key
# SAFETRE_LLM_MODEL=provider/model-name

# --- Synthetic-data dev only: ExampleProvider remote planner ---
# SAFETRE_LLM=exampleprovider
# SAFETRE_ALLOW_REMOTE_LLM=1
# PROVIDER_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
# SAFETRE_LLM_MODEL=provider-pass/hosted-max

# --- Disclosure policy overrides (optional) ---
# SAFETRE_MIN_CELL=10

# --- Safepod / restricted-channel controls ---
# In production the app should only accept traffic from the restricted channel
# gateway. For the tailscale-serve topology, the gateway talks to uvicorn over
# localhost, so loopback is the only allowed peer.
# SAFETRE_RESTRICTED_CHANNEL=1
# SAFETRE_CHANNEL_ALLOW_NETS=127.0.0.1/32,::1/128
# SAFETRE_REQUIRE_IDENTITY=1
# SAFETRE_ALLOWLIST=alex@example.org,sam@example.org

# --- Audit log ---
# SAFETRE_AUDIT_DB=/var/lib/safetre/audit.db
# SAFETRE_AUDIT_KEY=load-from-off-box-secret
